This project is an AI-powered automation system built with n8n that generates and publishes social media content automatically.

When a user submits a form, the system:

Extracts user input
Uses AI to generate engaging content
Automatically posts the content across multiple social media platforms

This helps save time and ensures consistent, high-quality content creation.

⚙️ Features
📝 Form-based input system
🤖 AI content generation (via Gemini/OpenAI)
📤 Automatic posting system
🔁 Multi-platform posting support
⚡ Fully automated workflow using n8n
🛠️ Tech Stack
n8n (Automation)
AI Model (Google Gemini / OpenAI)
Webhooks / Forms
Social Media APIs
📊 Workflow Overview
User submits form
Data goes to n8n
AI generates post content
Content is sent to multiple social platforms
Posts are published automatically
📌 Use Cases
Personal Branding
Social Media Agencies
Content Creators
SaaS Marketing Automation
🔮 Future Improvements
Image generation support
Hashtag optimization
Analytics tracking
Scheduling system
